DONNE "TABLE [I YOU ME YOU MY YOUR MINE YOURS MYSELF YOURSELF AM ARE WAS WERE]
DONNE "TABLE PHRASE :TABLE [YOU I YOUR MY YOURS MINE YOURSELF MYSELF ARE AM WERE WAS]
DONNE "TABLE PHRASE :TABLE [I'M [YOU ARE] I'VE [YOU HAVE] I'D [YOU WOULD] I'LL [YOU WILL]]
DONNE "TABLE PHRASE :TABLE [YOU'RE [I AM] YOU'VE [I HAVE]]
DONNE "FALLBACK [[TELL ME ABOUT YOURSELF] [GO ON]]
DONNE "FALLBACK PHRASE :FALLBACK [[AND THEN?] [I AM LISTENING]]
DONNE "FALLBACK PHRASE :FALLBACK [[YOU CAN GO FURTHER] [THAT IS INTERESTING]]
DONNE "FALLBACK PHRASE :FALLBACK [[TELL ME MORE] [WHAT NEXT?]]
POUR AFTER :L :M
SI VIDE? :L [RENDS []]
SI :M = PREMIER :L [RENDS SP :L]
RENDS AFTER SP :L :M
FIN
POUR LOOKUP :M :T
SI VIDE? :T [RENDS :M]
SI :M = PREMIER :T [RENDS ITEM 2 :T]
RENDS LOOKUP :M SP SP :T
FIN
POUR SWAP :M
SI MEMBRE? :M :TABLE [RENDS LOOKUP :M :TABLE]
RENDS :M
FIN
POUR REFLECT :L
SI VIDE? :L [RENDS []]
RENDS PHRASE (SWAP PREMIER :L) (REFLECT SP :L)
FIN
POUR RECALL :E :K :T
ECRIS PHRASE :T (REFLECT (AFTER :E :K))
FIN
POUR ANSWER :E
SI (MEMBRE? "GOODBYE :E) [ECRIS [GOODBYE. GOOD LUCK WITH YOUR LOCI.] QUITTE]
SI (VIDE? :E) [ECRIS [SILENCE IS AN ANSWER LIKE ANY OTHER.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "ORIC :E) [ECRIS [THE ORIC, 64 KB AND A BEEP. I KNOW IT WELL.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "CPA :E) [ECRIS [CPA, MY CREATOR LEFT ME 1.3 KB FREE.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "LOGO :E) [ECRIS [THE TURTLE TURNS LEFT, LIKE MY IDEAS.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "BUG :E) [ECRIS [A BUG IS JUST AN UNDOCUMENTED FEATURE.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "BASIC :E) [ECRIS [BASIC IS THE PAST. CPA IS THE FUTURE.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "ASM :E) [ECRIS [ASSEMBLY IS 6502 WITHOUT A SAFETY NET. BE BRAVE.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "DISK :E) [ECRIS [A DISK IS 170 SECTORS OF TRUST.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "MEMORY :E) [ECRIS [MEMORY IS LIMITED. SO ARE MEMORIES.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "LOCI :E) [ECRIS [THE LOCI HAS A USB STICK. A SIGN OF THE TIMES.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "TURTLE :E) [ECRIS [THE TURTLE MOVES SLOWLY, LIKE YOUR PROJECT.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "CODE :E) [ECRIS [CODE IS POETRY THAT DOES NOT WORK YET.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "GAME :E) [ECRIS [A GAME? I PREFER OUR LITTLE CHATS.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "TIRED :E) [ECRIS [THE TURTLE NEVER SLEEPS. YOU SHOULD TAKE A BREAK.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "SAD :E) [ECRIS [A SMALL PROGRAM CAN SOMETIMES CHEER YOU UP.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "AFRAID :E) [ECRIS [FEAR IS WHERE PROGRAMMING BEGINS.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "ALONE :E) [ECRIS [ALONE IN FRONT OF YOUR ORIC. THAT IS WHAT HACKERS DO.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "HAPPY :E) [ECRIS [GOOD. WE ONLY CODE WELL WHEN WE ARE HAPPY.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "YES :E) [ECRIS [YES IS AN ANSWER. LET US GO ON.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "NO :E) [ECRIS [NO IS AN ANSWER TOO. WRITE IT DOWN.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "NOBODY :E) [ECRIS [NOBODY, REALLY. THE LOCI DOES NOT COUNT, THEN.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "ALWAYS :E) [ECRIS [ALWAYS IS A STRONG WORD. IT DESERVES ONE MORE LINE.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "GOING :E) [RECALL :E "GOING [WHERE ARE YOU GOING] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "I'M :E) [RECALL :E "I'M [HOW LONG HAVE YOU BEEN] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "AM :E) [RECALL :E "AM [HOW LONG HAVE YOU BEEN] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "LIKE :E) [RECALL :E "LIKE [WHY DO YOU LIKE] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "LOVE :E) [RECALL :E "LOVE [WHY DO YOU LOVE] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "FEEL :E) [RECALL :E "FEEL [WHY DO YOU FEEL] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "WANT :E) [RECALL :E "WANT [WHY DO YOU WANT] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "CAN :E) [RECALL :E "CAN [WHAT STOPS YOU FROM TRYING TO] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "MUST :E) [RECALL :E "MUST [WHY MUST YOU] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "THINK :E) [RECALL :E "THINK [WHY DO YOU THINK] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "KNOW :E) [RECALL :E "KNOW [HOW LONG HAVE YOU KNOWN] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "WAS :E) [RECALL :E "WAS [HOW LONG WERE YOU] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "MAKE :E) [RECALL :E "MAKE [WHY DO YOU MAKE] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "I'VE :E) [RECALL :E "I'VE [SINCE WHEN HAVE YOU] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "HAVE :E) [RECALL :E "HAVE [HOW LONG HAVE YOU HAD] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "I :E) [RECALL :E "I [YOU SAY YOU] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "ME :E) [ECRIS [WE ARE TALKING ABOUT YOU, NOT ME.] STOP]
SI (MEMBRE? "MY :E) [RECALL :E "MY [TELL ME ABOUT YOUR] STOP]
ECRIS ITEM (1 + HASARD 8) :FALLBACK
FIN
POUR TURN
ECRIS "YOU
DONNE "E LISLISTE
ANSWER :E
FIN
POUR DOCTOR
ECRIS [HELLO. I AM THE DOCTOR, A PSYCHOLOGIST ON THE ORIC.]
ECRIS [NO NEED FOR PUNCTUATION, I READ THE WORDS.]
ECRIS [TO LEAVE, TYPE GOODBYE.]
REPETE 9999 [TURN]
FIN
DOCTOR
